{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0311","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:000000ed:text","row":40075,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"くたびれた……。","en":"I was beat...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904781","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00001","en":"Worn down to exhaustion...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:0000011d:text","row":40076,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんか……全然進展しないな」","en":"“Man... I was getting nowhere.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904782","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00002","en":"Taichi: \"It's just... there's no progress at all, no.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:000001d9:text","row":40077,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「でしょうね」","en":"“No surprise there.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904783","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00003","en":"Youko: \"Isn't there.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"Youko dryly agrees that of course there has been no progress. The English forms a tag-like question that can imply progress does exist.","remedy":"I wouldn't expect any.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":20,"start":8,"text":"Isn't there."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:000001ff:text","row":40078,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"神出鬼没。支倉曜子。","en":"Now you see her, now you don't. Youko Hasekura.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904784","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00004","en":"The elusive phantom. Hasekura Youko.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:00000233:text","row":40079,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「……見てたの？」","en":"“...Were you watching?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904785","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00005","en":"Taichi: \"...you saw, right?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"Taichi asks whether she was watching. The English asserts that she saw and asks for confirmation.","remedy":"Were you watching?","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":27,"start":12,"text":"you saw, right?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:00000282:text","row":40080,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「全部ではないけれど」","en":"“Not all of it.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904786","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00006","en":"Youko: \"Not all of it, however.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:000002b8:text","row":40081,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「悪趣味」","en":"“That's creepy.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904787","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00007","en":"Taichi: \"Creepy hobby.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:00000360:text","row":40082,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「……汗、かいてる」","en":"“...You’re sweating.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904788","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00008","en":"Youko: \"...you're sweating.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:0000038c:text","row":40083,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"ハンカチでふいてくれる。","en":"She wiped the sweat away with a handkerchief.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904789","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00009","en":"She wipes me with a handkerchief.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:000003c4:text","row":40084,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいよ、汗なんて」","en":"“It’s fine. It’s only sweat.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904790","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00010","en":"Taichi: \"It's fine, it's just sweat.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:000003f0:text","row":40085,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"のける。","en":"I brushed her hand away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904791","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00011","en":"I push her aside,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","overinterpretation"],"assessment":"The narrator pushes away her hand or handkerchief. The English says he moves Youko's whole body aside.","remedy":"I push her hand away","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":16,"start":0,"text":"I push her aside"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:00000410:text","row":40086,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"でもやめてはくれない。","en":"But she wouldn't stop.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904792","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00012","en":"but she does not oblige me with stopping.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","presentation"],"assessment":"The construction is non-idiomatic and obscures the simple fact that she will not stop wiping him.","remedy":"she still won't stop","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":40,"start":4,"text":"she does not oblige me with stopping"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:0000043e:text","row":40087,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"強く拒絶しなければ、駄目なのだった。","en":"Only a firm no would get through to her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904793","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00013","en":"Without a strong rejection that is simply not going to happen.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0311:00000482:text","row":40088,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「ま、いいけどさ……」","en":"“Well... I guess it's fine...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904794","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0017:00014","en":"Taichi: \"Well, whatever, but...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
